OL,3,AAndy Burnham says Welsh Labour may have
OL,4,Alost sight of devolution
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister has told members of
OL,7,Fhis party that Welsh Labour may have
OL,8,Flost sight of some of the principles of
OL,9,Fdevolution before it was thrown out of
OL,10,Fpower in a historic election defeat.
OL,12,FOn Saturday morning Andy Burnham
OL,13,Faddressed the first Welsh Labour
OL,14,Fconference since May's Senedd election.
OL,16,FHe suggested the previous Labour
OL,17,Fgovernment did not do enough to pass
OL,18,Fpowers down to communities, and said it
OL,19,Fwas "hard" to accept the party was no
OL,20,Flonger in power after 27 years of
OL,21,Frunning the Welsh government.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
